Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 14:48:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/17] Add a Practice Dummy that auto-plays GBA port 3

A toggle in GBA Link settings rhythmically presses A on the second
integrated GBA when netplay is not running, so one player can run a
full XD GBA-vs-GBA battle alone: the dummy mashes through Emerald's
battle menus picking the first move. Useful for testing the whole
battle flow and as a scripted sparring partner.
